title: Dictation and voice capture (code)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Opening the live preview" as s0
  state "Voice fill button idle" as s1
  state "Dictation ended" as s2
  state "Listening with live preview" as s3
  state "Listening, recording only" as s4
  state "Waiting for the server's transcript" as s5
  state "Asking for the microphone" as s6
  state "Recording while the button shows idle" as s7
  state "Finishing the live transcript" as s8
  state "Live preview kept a failed piece" as s9
  state "Voice bar working it out" as s10
  state "Clip recording" as s11
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: the server answers the live offer / you discard or leave the page
  s0 --> s3: the live channel opens
  s0 --> s4: the 10 second connect timer fires / the live channel drops / the server answers the live offer
  s0 --> s5: the 10 minute cap stops it / you press stop
  s1 --> s6: you press the voice fill button
  s1 --> s7: the browser grants the microphone
  s3 --> s2: you discard or leave the page
  s3 --> s4: OpenAI reports an error / the live channel drops
  s3 --> s8: the 10 minute cap stops it / you press stop
  s3 --> s9: OpenAI completes a piece
  s4 --> s2: you discard or leave the page
  s4 --> s5: the 10 minute cap stops it / you press stop
  s5 --> s2: the server splits the speakers / the server transcribes the recording / you discard or leave the page
  s5 --> s10: the server transcribes the recording
  s6 --> s1: the browser denies an old request / the browser denies the microphone / you press Escape
  s6 --> s11: the browser grants the microphone
  s7 --> s1: the 40 minute cap stops it
  s8 --> s2: you discard or leave the page
  s8 --> s5: OpenAI completes a piece / OpenAI confirms the last words / OpenAI fails a piece / OpenAI reports an error / the 8 second finish timer fires / the live channel drops
  s8 --> s9: OpenAI completes a piece
  s8 --> s10: OpenAI completes a piece / OpenAI confirms the last words
  s10 --> s2: the 240 second abort fires / voice fill answers
  s11 --> s1: the 40 minute cap stops it / the browser denies an old request / you press Escape / you press stop
  classDef breaks fill:#fde2dd,stroke:#b3261e,stroke-width:2px
